{
  "item": "GoldenDragon01",
  "mu_name": "Golden Dragon",
  "mu_name_from": "OpenMU VersionSeasonSix InvasionMobsInitialization.cs:74-101 names breed 79 'Golden Dragon' (MuMain's _enum.h calls 79 MONSTER_GOLDEN_DERKON and its 44 MONSTER_GOLDEN_DRAGON; both are this body, CreateMonster ZzzCharacter.cpp:13526-13530 and :13823-13827). Drawn as MONSTER_MODEL_DRAGON = 31 (_enum.h:4181), so OpenMonsterModel loads Monster32.bmd -- the same body the Golden Invasion's flying dragons wear (GOBoid.cpp:1280) and the Red Dragon at 1.3. Out of 0.75's period, like the invasion: MU2/docs/golden-invasion.md.",
  "world": "lorencia",
  "object_type": 79,
  "summoned_in": "lorencia",
  "summoned_in_from": "No spawn box: the Golden Invasion raises it where it lands (BaseInvasionPlugIn's CreateMonstersAsync, MU2/docs/golden-invasion.md), so it is cooked with the world it invades, as Bali with Noria.",
  "monster": {
    "model_index": 31,
    "scale": 0.9
  },
  "monster_from": "ZzzCharacter.cpp:13823-13827, CreateMonster, case MONSTER_GOLDEN_DRAGON: OpenMonsterModel(MONSTER_MODEL_DRAGON); CreateCharacter(Key, MODEL_DRAGON_, ...); Scale = 0.9f. No weapon. On appearing it takes MONSTER01_STOP2 and roars, mBullAttack1 (AppearMonster, WSclient.cpp:2767-2772).",
  "plus": {
    "parts": 7
  },
  "plus_from": "The golden monsters' pair, RENDER_METAL | RENDER_BRIGHT and RENDER_CHROME | RENDER_BRIGHT at Bright 1 over the body (ZzzCharacter.cpp:8716-8730; the flying dragon's SubType 1 the same, GOBoid.cpp:1540-1546): the chrome a +7 item is drawn with, in MU's gold, as no colour is named.",
  "profile": "monster",
  "rig_from": "Exported with --actions=all: eight actions, 94 bones. 0 idle, 1 the roar (MONSTER01_STOP2, which OpenMonsterModel marks Loop -- held at its end -- for the dragon, ZzzOpenData.cpp:3610-3617), 2 the walk, 3 and 4 the attacks, 5 the shock, 6 the death and 7 the flight, MONSTER01_DIE + 1, which only the event's flying dragons play (GOBoid.cpp:1398). Bone 11 is named attack01: the mouth, where MuMain puts the flying dragon's breath and the Red Dragon's fire (GOBoid.cpp:1549-1555, ZzzCharacter.cpp:1939-1947). Speeds in actions.json's action_overrides under 31.",
  "sheets": {
    "drr_01": "dragon_drr_01.png",
    "drr_02": "dragon_drr_02.png",
    "drr_03": "dragon_drr_03.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Data/Monster's drr_01.OZJ (the tail, legs and claws, 422 triangles), drr_02.OZJ (the wings, 274) and drr_03.OZJ (the body and head, 404), each 256 square, no alpha, under a dragon_ prefix. A red-orange dragon: the gold is the chrome, not the painting.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "drr_01": "chitin",
    "drr_02": "leather",
    "drr_03": "chitin"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "As the Budge Dragon's: the scaled hide a shell, a little glossy (chitin); the wings a membrane, duller (leather).",
  "sounds_from": "ZzzOpenData.cpp:3616-3624: SetMonsterSound(..., 123, 123, 124, 124, 125), offsets from SOUND_MONSTER_BULL1 = 210 -- 333 to move, 334 to attack and flinch, 335 to die; the arm loads mYeti1, mBullAttack1 and mYetiDie for them. Wired as goldendragon_* in sounds.json.",
